"text": "Instagram books your weddings. It can't tell a couple whether they can afford you.\n\nWhat a wedding photographer website needs:\n1. A starting price, visible\n2. Eight weddings, chosen carefully\n3. Your style in one sentence, at the top\n4. Dates you still have open\n\n📌 Save this for when you update your site.\n\nDescribe your business in plain language and get a free preview in about 30 seconds, no sign-up. Pay only if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#weddingphotographer #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
