"text": "A website prompt for a gym. Copy it and change the details:\n\n\"Small strength gym in Portland, Oregon. Bold, industrial, black and yellow. Barbells, kettlebells and coaching, with no cardio machines in sight. Intro offer, class schedule, trainers, membership tiers.\"\n\nWho and where, the mood, what's different, what to show. Write it in your own language: the copy follows it.\n\n📌 Save this for when you update your site.\n\nDescribe your business in plain language and get a free preview in about 30 seconds, no sign-up. Pay only if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#gymowner #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
